msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "Miwiti scan pasuryan"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Pindai model rai"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ora bisa nyimpen model pasuryan"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Pindai model kapindho"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Ora bisa ngrekam model kapindho"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Model sepisanan sampeyan wis kasimpen, dadi mlebu nganggo rai wis bisa"
". Priksa manawa rai sampeyan cukup padhang lan ana ing tengah, banjur "
"coba maneh — utawa lewati lan tambahake model mengko saka Setelan."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Tambahake model rai (wajib)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Mlebu nganggo rai mbutuhake paling ora siji model rai, dadi pindai iki"
" ora bisa dilewati. Rekam ing cahya panggonan sampeyan biasane lungguh"
". Cahya ngowahi carane kamera ndeleng rai sampeyan, dadi pikirake namb"
"ah model kapindho mengko saka Setelan sing direkam ing cahya sing beda"
" (contone lampu ing wayah wengi tinimbang cahya awan)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Tambahake model rai kapindho (disaranake)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Model sepisanan sampeyan wis kasimpen. Cahya ngowahi carane kamera nde"
"leng rai sampeyan: model sing direkam ing cahya awan bisa gagal ing wa"
"yah wengi ing sangisore lampu (utawa kosok baline), lan Ubuntu Hello b"
"anjur entek wektu tinimbang mbukak kunci. Model kapindho sing direkam "
"ing cahya sing beda njaga pangenalan tetep bisa dipercaya kapan wae."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Owahi cahya dhisik: urupake utawa pateni lampu kamar utawa lampu meja,"
" mengo saka jendhela, utawa nganggo kacamata sing kadhang sampeyan gun"
"akake. Banjur deleng langsung menyang kamera lan pencet Pindai."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Persiapan Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello bisa mbukak kunci {} kanthi otomatis nggunakake otentikas"
"i pasuryan (dompet sing dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Priksa h"
"ardware lan alat TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello bisa mbukak kunci {} kanthi otomatis nggunakake otentikas"
"i pasuryan (dompet sing dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> TPM hard"
"ware dideteksi. Nginstal <i>tpm2-tools</i> kanthi otomatis..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello bisa mbukak kunci {} kanthi otomatis nggunakake otentikas"
"i pasuryan (dompet sing dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Hardware"
" TPM 2.0 aktif. Tembung sandhi sampeyan bakal disegel kanthi aman ing "
"TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello bisa mbukak kunci {} kanthi otomatis nggunakake otentikas"
"i pasuryan (dompet sing dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Perangka"
"t keras TPM dideteksi, nanging instalasi otomatis <i>tpm2-tools</i> ga"
"gal. Jalanake <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Mudhun bali me"
"nyang caching kredensial basis piranti lunak."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello bisa mbukak kunci {} kanthi otomatis nggunakake otentikas"
"i pasuryan (dompet sing dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Ora ana "
"hardware TPM sing dideteksi. Nggunakake caching kredensial basis piran"
"ti lunak (AES-256-GCM)."

